  "scope": "Derive the squared Pell seed coefficient positivity from a positive product",
  "validation": "Paired target and both tracked direct Lean clients compile, with identical client objects and matching target namespace type/axiom and global simp/instance reports. Direct Periodicity and HalfIndex source/object pairs match prior current-source producer receipts.",
  "limitations": [
    "The project, Foundation and Mathlib transitive closure was not rebuilt. Direct provider source/object matches rely on prior producer receipts rather than fresh source samples during these builds.",
    "Post-build search paths resolve older IntegralSolution 0ca27c03… and SignedPairs 5b043450… objects; prior old-source receipts are included, but path samples do not pin actual transitive objects loaded at build time.",
    "Single shared-load timing pairs are not general benchmarks. Matching declaration/registration reports do not establish equality of proof bodies, every persistent extension or behavior of untested downstream AuxiliarySeed clients.",
    "Compiled objects are excluded; recorded hashes and first-provider paths require external objects for independent byte verification."
  ],
